    "content": "A highly anticipated measure aimed at regulating digital assets has stumbled in the Senate. The legislation failed to advance amid growing conflict-of-interest concerns involving President Trump. As a result, regulators may now be forced to independently forge the necessary blueprint for overseeing the growing sector.",
